## Action: `write-plan-slices`

Write the master plan and per-repo plan slices for a workspace feature.

INPUT CONTEXT will include: `action`, `ticketKey`, `affectedRepos`,
`implementationOrder`, `prMergeOrder`, `prMergeRationale`, `masterPlanPath`,
`slicesDir`

### Step 1: Read existing execution plans per repo

For each repo in `affectedRepos`, read the per-repo execution plan if one
was already written (it may be under `specs/<NNN>-<TICKET>-<slug>/execution-plan.md`
inside that repo). If not present, note "plan not yet written" for that repo.

